  "description": "Lohandra, a countryside town far away from the capital. The young ladies of the village are easily swayed by the words of a lady visiting from the capital.\n\n\"Oh my, everyone in the capital does it. This is why people call Rohendra the countryside.\"\n\n*And what is life in the capital like?\nFor example, having your first time with a childhood friend, or sleeping with your fiancé before marriage.*\n\nGoodness, how scandalous. Still, if that's what people in the capital do(?), the ladies of Lohandra refuse to be outdone.\nThe scandal of the cheeky ladies of Lohandra!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856709), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14830619)",
